{"unit_id":"xiaoxianyu-office__dsh-router-flash#card-zh","repo":"xiaoxianyu-office/dsh-router-flash","commit":"554d3aedf76202f82eb263833f55d934774cc58f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-router-flash 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 agent preset 分发插件。宿主启动时，它把 router-flash preset 同步到 DSH 目录。Preset 为 Flash 模型加入分类、回顾和收敛引导，并选择首轮工具；首次工具调用后开放完整目录。非 Flash 模型则按任务关键词分类。适合使用 opencode-go 与 DeepSeek V4 Flash 的 DSH 用户。宿主需提供 fs 和 sandboxPolicy 服务，用户还需配置模型及默认 preset。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:38-77","preset/router-bootstrap.mjs:27-60","preset/router-core.mjs:38-47","preset/router-core.mjs:82-108"]}
